| LXQt		   | ~300 MB                   | Very fast  | Basic GUI tools   | Light       	 |
| XFCE        	   | ~450–600 MB               | Fast       | Balanced          | Light          |
| MATE             | ~500–700 MB               | Fast       | Traditional       | Light-Mid      |
| Openbox/i3       | ~150–250 MB               | Ultra fast | Minimal           | Ultra-Light    |
| KDE Plasma       | ~750–900 MB (Plasma 5/6)  | Fast       | Very feature-rich | Medium         |
| GNOME            | ~1.1–1.6 GB               | Smooth     | Very modern       | Heavy          |
